    REVISION 		"202605100000Z"
    DESCRIPTION 	"OBA32 is an improved amplifier version of OBA3, 
                in which a different set of parameters has been applied.
                Renamed notifications to Active and Clear and renamed
                threshold objects from Act and Clr. Added new notifications
                for power supply 1 and power supply 2, constant pump power
                mode error Active/Clear, and constant gain mode error
                Active/Clear. Updated input and output power descriptions
                for ports A and B (PiA, PiB, PoA, PoB) and removed ac and dc
