    STATUS          current
    DESCRIPTION
        "Generated when the difference between devOBA32ObParPumpPower and devOBA32ObParSetPumpPower returns below 2% of devOBA32ObParSetPumpPower.
        Indicates return to normal amplifier operation. Together with ConstGainModeError, confirms proper EDFA functionality."
    ::= { devOBA32Notifications 122 }

